e impetus on the upside, this positive sentiment has eased panicky selling pressures. As such, investors are currently reassessing the new cryptos to buy, including those beyond Shiba Inu, chiefly in search of optimal growth asymmetry. Mutuum Finance (MUTM) Presale Continues The focus is also on Mutuum Finance (MUTM) , where the presale is now at a critical level. Phase 6 is about 98% full, and sales are happening fast as there is a sense of urgency. The price for the ongoing Phase 6 is $0.035, indicating a price jump of 250%, or 3.5 times, the price seen during Phase 1, where it was priced at $0.01. Overall, since the presale started, a sum of $19,500,000 has been accumulated, and there are also a cumulative 18,530 MUTM holders. Phase 6 is selling out fast, and the opportunity for purchases at this price is limited. Phase 7 will be live immediately after sell-out, marking a forthcoming price rise by about a near 20% price rise to $0.04, along with a launch price set at $0.06. Based on expectations, purchasers are set to see a 420% ROI. Mutuum Finance (MUTM) – Utility and Development Project updates continue to instill continued confidence in Mutuum Finance (MUTM). The team announced the launch of V1 protocol, which will go live on the Sepolia testnet in Q4 2025, with the focus finalized on liquidity pools, mtTokens, debt tokens, and the liquidator bot, with the supported assets to be ETH and USDT. Security continues to be top of the agenda, with an independent security audit currently in progress, and Mutuum’s lending and borrowing contracts currently under review by Halborn Security. The code lock ensures a lower risk of execution while the initial users take the first steps to explore the best cryptocurrency to invest in now. Mutuum Finance (MUTM) Engagement & Incentive Structure Community engagement has driven presale momentum thus far. A recently integrated tool offers a real-time leaderboard displaying the top 50 holders. The 24-Hour Leaderboard offers rewards